	"lexical": {
		"root": {
			"children": [
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "英語をやりたいという80代のおばあちゃんに触発されて去年から僕も",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						},
						{
							"children": [
								{
									"detail": 0,
									"format": 0,
									"mode": "normal",
									"style": "",
									"text": "Duolingo",
									"type": "extended-text",
									"version": 1
								}
							],
							"direction": "ltr",
							"format": "",
							"indent": 0,
							"type": "link",
							"version": 1,
							"rel": "noreferrer",
							"target": null,
							"title": null,
							"url": "https://www.duolingo.com/"
						},
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "を再開して続けている。1600日の連続記録が途切れてからずっとやってなかったが、久々に見ると大幅にアップデートされているのでもう一度全部コンプを目指して毎日ちびちびとやっている。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": null,
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "スマホ版に新しく追加されたのが発音問題で、2つの発音をランダムでピックして選ぶ問題がスキマ時間にスピーディにできて良い感じ。選ばれる発音によってすごい簡単な問題からめちゃくちゃ難しい問題まで難易度が様々で面白い。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": null,
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "なかでもThinとThingが不可能なレベルに難しい。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						},
						{
							"children": [
								{
									"detail": 0,
									"format": 0,
									"mode": "normal",
									"style": "",
									"text": "Thin",
									"type": "extended-text",
									"version": 1
								}
							],
							"direction": null,
							"format": "",
							"indent": 0,
							"type": "link",
							"version": 1,
							"rel": null,
							"target": null,
							"title": null,
							"url": "https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/thin"
						},
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "は/θɪn/で、",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						},
						{
							"children": [
								{
									"detail": 0,
									"format": 0,
									"mode": "normal",
									"style": "",
									"text": "Thing",
									"type": "extended-text",
									"version": 1
								}
							],
							"direction": null,
							"format": "",
							"indent": 0,
							"type": "link",
							"version": 1,
							"rel": null,
							"target": null,
							"title": null,
							"url": "https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/thing"
						},
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "は/θɪŋ/で違いがnがngか。おまけにDuolingoに収録されている音声は「グ」が省略されている発音なので、空気の通り方の絶妙な違いを聞き分けるしかない。非常に難しい。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": null,
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"type": "image",
					"version": 1,
					"src": "https://hanatane.net/content/images/2024/01/lesson9_1.jpg",
					"width": null,
					"height": null,
					"title": "",
					"alt": "mとnとngの発音の違い",
					"caption": "<span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">引用: </span><a href=\"https://elc.polyu.edu.hk/sounds/lesson9.htm\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">https://elc.polyu.edu.hk/sounds/lesson9.htm</span></a>",
					"cardWidth": "regular",
					"href": ""
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "こんなんネイティブでも聞き取れんやろ！！って思って文字起こしとかを通すとしっかり聞き分けられているのでびっくりする。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": null,
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "英語の発音を日本語で学ぶ時はあいおうえおフォニックスがかなり充実しているのでおすすめ。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": null,
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
